# Scribbles and temporary work are never committed.
#
# These are the fleet's scratch locations: `.auxiliary/scribbles/` holds
# throw-away experiments, `.auxiliary/temporary/` holds ephemeral test
# state and build artifacts that are safe to delete. See the project
# agent instructions for the current conventions.
/scribbles/
/temporary/
# Per-host local cistella configuration (e.g. the dogfood profile).
# Not committed with code; shared, non-host-specific configuration under
# configuration/ may still be version-controlled.
/configuration/cistella/profiles/cistella-dev.toml
